    "bbox": [
      69.69,
      568.33,
      547.1,
      603.4
    ],
    "text": "2.A person eligible to be appointed as a Member of a Panel of Mediators, in the Special Mediation Board area specifiedin the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2125/8 of May 27, 2019 relating to a dispute of the category ofdisputes determined by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2078/36 dated July 04, 2018, shall :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
